msgid "Networking and Interprocess Communication"
msgstr ""

msgid "The modules described in this chapter provide mechanisms for networking and inter-processes communication."
msgstr ""

msgid "Some modules only work for two processes that are on the same machine, e.g. :mod:`signal` and :mod:`mmap`.  Other modules support networking protocols that two or more processes can use to communicate across machines."
msgstr ""

